  <Document>
    <name>❄️ LIVE SNOW COVERAGE</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2>❄️ LIVE SNOW COVERAGE</h2><p><b>Data time:</b> 2026-09-24 03:00 PM EDT<br/><b>Source updated:</b> n/a (NOMADS)<br/><b>Source version:</b> hrrr-hrrr.20260924-t19z<br/><b>Processed:</b> 2026-09-24 04:26 PM EDT<br/><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT MODEL (analysis)</p><p><b>Legend</b><br><img src="https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/snow_coverage/legend.png?v=hrrr-hrrr.20260924-t19z" width="600" alt="legend"><br>Snow depth on the ground (in), continuous: <b>LOWEST 0</b> (silver-gray) → <b>HIGHEST+ 24</b> (white extreme). Shows snow currently on the ground. Falling snow, clouds, precipitation without confirmed ground snow, and uncertain observations are transparent.</p><p><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3 km snow analysis (SNOD snow depth + SNOWC snow cover), hourly cycles<br/><a href="https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl">https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl</a></p><p>Transparent outside valid water data so existing project layers (shipwrecks, lighthouses, harbors, parks) stay visible. Turn on/off independently of all other layers.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p>]]></description>
    <Folder>
      <name>❄️ LIVE SNOW COVERAGE</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>❄️ LIVE SNOW COVERAGE</h2><p>Shows snow currently on the ground. Falling snow, clouds, precipitation without confirmed ground snow, and uncertain observations are transparent.</p><p><img src="https://wyattleathorn7.github.io/great-lakes-live-environment/snow_coverage/legend.png?v=hrrr-hrrr.20260924-t19z" width="600" alt="key"></p><p>Snow depth on the ground (in), continuous: <b>LOWEST 0</b> (silver-gray) → <b>HIGHEST+ 24</b> (white extreme). Shows snow currently on the ground. Falling snow, clouds, precipitation without confirmed ground snow, and uncertain observations are transparent.</p><p><b>Units:</b> in (source metres)<br/><b>Source:</b> NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3 km snow analysis (SNOD snow depth + SNOWC snow cover), hourly cycles<br/><b>Update:</b> hourly analysis cycles<br/><b>Data time:</b> 2026-09-24 03:00 PM EDT<br/><b>Processed:</b> 2026-09-24 04:26 PM EDT<br/><b>Provenance:</b> <a href="https://nomads.ncep.noaa.gov/cgi-bin/filter_hrrr_2d.pl">NOMADS HRRR</a></p>]]></description>
